{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00530",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.59,
      "end_seconds": 13.82,
      "duration_seconds": 13.23,
      "text": "Good morning. I made a list so I wouldn't forget anything. Short version, I can't read my newspaper anymore, and it's driving me up the wall."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.44,
      "end_seconds": 26.56,
      "duration_seconds": 10.12,
      "text": "Good morning, Mr Kowalski. Let's get right into it. When did you first notice trouble with the newspaper?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.46,
      "end_seconds": 36.79,
      "duration_seconds": 9.33,
      "text": "I wrote it down. The twelfth of August I couldn't make out the crossword clues. So about three months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.13,
      "end_seconds": 46.41,
      "duration_seconds": 7.28,
      "text": "Three months. Is it all blurry, or is a part of the page missing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.46,
      "end_seconds": 58.93,
      "duration_seconds": 11.47,
      "text": "It's blurry in the middle of my vision. The edges are fine. If I look right at a word, it disappears."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.1,
      "end_seconds": 67.04,
      "duration_seconds": 6.94,
      "text": "That's a very specific description, thank you. Any other changes in how things look?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 69.67,
      "end_seconds": 80.71,
      "duration_seconds": 11.04,
      "text": "Yes, straight lines look wavy. The tiles in the bathroom, the door frame. Marisol noticed me running my hand along the wall."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 83.39,
      "end_seconds": 91.76,
      "duration_seconds": 8.37,
      "text": "He was checking if the wall was bent. I told him the wall is fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.49,
      "end_seconds": 97.67,
      "duration_seconds": 5.18,
      "text": "Marisol, you live with him, correct? Are you his full-time caregiver?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 99.48,
      "end_seconds": 108.04,
      "duration_seconds": 8.56,
      "text": "Live-in, yes, for two years now. I do the driving too, which is how he got here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.35,
      "end_seconds": 116.28,
      "duration_seconds": 5.93,
      "text": "Good to have you. Mr Kowalski, anything else on your list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 118.37,
      "end_seconds": 131.57,
      "duration_seconds": 13.2,
      "text": "Headlights at night are blinding. The glare is much worse than before. And I tripped on the curb twice, last Tuesday and Friday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.67,
      "end_seconds": 138.79,
      "duration_seconds": 6.12,
      "text": "Twice in one week is important. Did you hurt yourself?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 141.56,
      "end_seconds": 144.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "A skinned knee. Nothing else."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.39,
      "end_seconds": 153.42,
      "duration_seconds": 6.03,
      "text": "Okay. Any flashing lights or floaters, anything like curtains coming across?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.43,
      "end_seconds": 157.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "No flashing lights. No curtain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.47,
      "end_seconds": 163.26,
      "duration_seconds": 4.79,
      "text": "And any pain in either eye, or redness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.5,
      "end_seconds": 169.54,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "No eye pain. They just feel tired."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.81,
      "end_seconds": 179.27,
      "duration_seconds": 8.46,
      "text": "Now, a quick check on the rest of you. Any weakness, numbness, or trouble speaking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 181.33,
      "end_seconds": 185.76,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "No, none of that. I'd have called 911."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.66,
      "end_seconds": 191.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "Exactly right. Let's go through your medicines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 192.86,
      "end_seconds": 204.65,
      "duration_seconds": 11.79,
      "text": "I have them here. Metformin, 500 mg twice a day. Lisinopril, 10 mg once a day. And atorvastatin, 20 mg at bedtime."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.25,
      "end_seconds": 215.05,
      "duration_seconds": 7.8,
      "text": "Good list. And what are they for, so I can match them up with your history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 217.43,
      "end_seconds": 224.92,
      "duration_seconds": 7.49,
      "text": "Type 2 diabetes, I've had that since 2004. High blood pressure. And high cholesterol."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.65,
      "end_seconds": 230.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "Okay. Any allergies to medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 231.96,
      "end_seconds": 240.12,
      "duration_seconds": 8.16,
      "text": "Sulfa drugs. I got a rash as a kid and my mother had me avoid them ever since."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.63,
      "end_seconds": 249.45,
      "duration_seconds": 6.82,
      "text": "A childhood rash from sulfa, avoided since, noted. Have you had any surgery?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 250.23,
      "end_seconds": 258.89,
      "duration_seconds": 8.66,
      "text": "Cataract surgery on the left eye in 2018. And a hernia repair about fifteen years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.56,
      "end_seconds": 263.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.4,
      "text": "Thank you. Anyone in the family with eye disease?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 264.93,
      "end_seconds": 270.17,
      "duration_seconds": 5.24,
      "text": "My mother had macular degeneration. My brother has glaucoma."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.07,
      "end_seconds": 274.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "That's relevant. Do you smoke or drink?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 276.64,
      "end_seconds": 286.22,
      "duration_seconds": 9.58,
      "text": "I quit smoking in 1990. One glass of wine with dinner. I live with Marisol, as she said."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 287.7,
      "end_seconds": 293.35,
      "duration_seconds": 5.65,
      "text": "Great. I'll do your vitals now, then examine your eyes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 313.59,
      "end_seconds": 323.42,
      "duration_seconds": 9.83,
      "text": "Blood pressure is 142 over 80. Heart rate is 68. Oxygen saturation 98 percent. Temperature 36.7 degrees. Weight is 82 kilograms."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 333.71,
      "end_seconds": 339.67,
      "duration_seconds": 5.96,
      "text": "Now cover your left eye and read the chart on the wall."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 341.46,
      "end_seconds": 348.16,
      "duration_seconds": 6.7,
      "text": "E. F. P. Then it gets fuzzy. I can't get the line after that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 365.14,
      "end_seconds": 374.15,
      "duration_seconds": 9.01,
      "text": "Visual acuity is 20 over 60 in the right eye. I'm shining a light in your eyes now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 384.96,
      "end_seconds": 394.15,
      "duration_seconds": 9.19,
      "text": "Your pupils react normally, and there's no redness in either eye. Your pressure feels normal to touch."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 395.23,
      "end_seconds": 398.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "Is this serious? Be straight with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 400.98,
      "end_seconds": 418.43,
      "duration_seconds": 17.45,
      "text": "I'll be straight. This looks like early macular degeneration, the same family of problem your mother had. With your diabetes I also want to rule out damage from the diabetes to the retina."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 419.61,
      "end_seconds": 421.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "Is there a cure?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 422.95,
      "end_seconds": 433.88,
      "duration_seconds": 10.93,
      "text": "Some forms can be treated and slowed, especially if we catch it early. That's why I'm moving quickly today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 434.8,
      "end_seconds": 438.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "What are you going to do?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 441.05,
      "end_seconds": 459.03,
      "duration_seconds": 17.98,
      "text": "I'll refer you to the ophthalmologist, and my team will book it this week. I also want an OCT scan, which takes a detailed picture of the back of the eye, and a visual field test."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 460.28,
      "end_seconds": 468.06,
      "duration_seconds": 7.78,
      "text": "I'd also like an HbA1c blood test today, to check your diabetes control."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 470.8,
      "end_seconds": 483.54,
      "duration_seconds": 12.74,
      "text": "Until then, good lighting for reading, a magnifier is fine, and get Marisol to hold your arm on curbs. No driving at night."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 485.67,
      "end_seconds": 490.09,
      "duration_seconds": 4.42,
      "text": "I haven't driven at night for a year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 491.86,
      "end_seconds": 497.79,
      "duration_seconds": 5.93,
      "text": "Good. I'll see you again in four weeks, with the scan results."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 500.26,
      "end_seconds": 504.98,
      "duration_seconds": 4.72,
      "text": "Four weeks. I'll write it in the diary."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 506.88,
      "end_seconds": 509.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "I'll remind him too."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 510.93,
      "end_seconds": 515.89,
      "duration_seconds": 4.96,
      "text": "Perfect. That's all from me. Any other questions on your list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 517.07,
      "end_seconds": 520.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "All crossed off. Thank you, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 521.4,
      "end_seconds": 524.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "Take care, both of you."
    }
  ]
}
